Package: com.iosvcam.opencam
Name: iOS-VCAM OpenCam
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Open-source, editable virtual camera tweak. Video-first reimplementation of the closed com.x.vcamera: pulls an RTMP stream on-device, decodes H264 via VideoToolbox, and replaces AVCaptureVideoDataOutput frames. Fail-open with a /var/mobile/vc.disabled kill switch.
Maintainer: iOS-VCAM
Author: iOS-VCAM
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Conflicts: com.x.vcamera
Replaces: com.x.vcamera
